KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
std::endl requires [temp.deduct.funcaddr] template argument deduction.
This works with libc++-18 but fails with libc++-20 because
basic_ostream is forward-declared in __fwd/ostream.h without
template metadata, causing the template instantiation to fail.
